</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><div class="top"><a class="back" href="/hospital.html">← Back to hospital</a><div class="brand">I Love My Body<small>FIRST VISIT</small></div></div><section class="hero"><div class="ey">NO LOGIN REQUIRED</div><h1>See the whole patient journey before you share anything.</h1><p>This is not a registration wall. First understand how the hospital works. When you later enter a private patient space, reports, prescriptions, measurements and treatment comparisons stay together in one journey.</p></section><div class="path"><div class="step"><b>01</b><h2>What happened?</h2><p>Your event, symptoms, diagnosis, timeline and what you want help with.</p></div><div class="step"><b>02</b><h2>Read the reports</h2><p>What is reassuring, what needs attention, what has improved and what is still unknown.</p></div><div class="step"><b>03</b><h2>Audit the prescription</h2><p>Medicine → desired effect → mechanism → side-effect path → ILMB target → measurement.</p></div><div class="step"><b>04</b><h2>Explore the body</h2><p>See which systems, pathways, functions and measurements connect to the case.</p></div><div class="step"><b>05</b><h2>Compare two paths</h2><p>Current medical treatment and ILMB are compared against the same required body output without inventing molecular equivalence.</p></div><div class="step"><b>06</b><h2>Build the ILMB plan</h2><p>Only measured or justified body needs switch on actions. No generic “eat well / exercise” list.</p></div><div class="step"><b>07</b><h2>Measure response</h2><p>Repeat the same outputs and learn the patient’s own response rather than assuming an average.</p></div><div class="step"><b>08</b><h2>Review the decision</h2><p>Keep · modify · investigate · escalate, with unknowns and safety boundaries visible.</p></div></div><section class="next"><div class="ey">CHOOSE YOUR NEXT STEP</div><h2>Continue without getting trapped in a login.</h2><p class="note">You can preview the private patient workspace with sample/empty data. Nothing is saved until you sign in to an activated patient record.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/app/?preview=1#records">Preview the patient workspace →</a><a class="secondary" href="/app/access.php">I already have patient access →</a><a href="/hospital.html">Keep exploring the hospital</a></div><div class="flow"><span>Explore</span><i>→</i><span>Reports</span><i>→</i><span>Prescription audit</span><i>→</i><span>ILMB comparison</span><i>→</i><span>Measure</span><i>→</i><span>Review</span></div></section></main></body></html>